# DDRMAX2 - Dance Dance Revolution 7th Mix (G*B20 VER. JAA), Konami 2002: the first boot's install, from blank NVRAM (no install cassette:
# the game cassette is in). No inputs: it installs itself, the CD to the onboard flash, then to the 32 MiB PC Card in slot 2
# (edit data). By frame ~21900 it shows INFO 508: install done, note the
# certificate number and power-cycle. Hashes the main RAM every frame and snapshots every 60
# frames, to compare HIRAKU's 573 core with MAME through the install.
game ddrmax2

hash ram  0x80000000 0x80400000   # 4 MiB main RAM (KSEG0)

from 0 every 60 snap
at 22800 quit
